{"term": {"label": "仁", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "3A", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/teng-wen-gong-i", "title": "滕文公上", "description": "滕文公為世子，將之楚，過宋而見孟子。孟子道性善，言必稱堯舜。\n世子自楚反，復見孟子。孟子曰：「世子疑吾言乎？夫道一而已矣。成覸謂齊景公曰：『彼丈夫也，我丈夫也，吾何畏彼哉？』顏淵曰：『舜何人也？予何人也？有為者亦若是。』公明儀曰：『文王我師也，周公豈欺我哉？』今滕，絕長補短，將五十里也，猶可以為善國。《書》曰：『若藥不", "occurrences": 8, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "人", "id": "人"}, {"form": "仁", "id": "仁"}, {"form": "先", "id": "先"}, {"form": "反", "id": "反"}, {"form": "君", "id": "君"}, {"form": "在", "id": "在"}, {"form": "天下", "id": "天下"}, {"form": "掩", "id": "掩"}, {"form": "政", "id": "政"}, {"form": "民", "id": "民"}, {"form": "父母", "id": "父母"}, {"form": "經界", "id": "經界"}, {"form": "聖人", "id": "聖人"}, {"form": "聞", "id": "聞"}, {"form": "行", "id": "行"}, {"form": "親", "id": "親"}], "edges": [{"weight": 2.7536607123542622, "source": "反", "target": "掩"}, {"weight": 2.2528854244417733, "source": "父母", "target": "民"}, {"weight": 2.571339155560308, "source": "父母", "target": "在"}, {"weight": 0.12899212019110332, "source": "聞", "target": "人"}, {"weight": 1.472726866892198, "source": "聞", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 1.6550484236861527, "source": "聞", "target": "君"}, {"weight": 2.571339155560308, "source": "聞", "target": "政"}, {"weight": 2.165874047452143, "source": "聞", "target": "行"}, {"weight": 1.8781919750003624, "source": "聞", "target": "聖人"}, {"weight": 1.3673663512343717, "source": "聖人", "target": "君"}, {"weight": 2.283657083108527, "source": "聖人", "target": "政"}, {"weight": 1.8781919750003624, "source": "聖人", "target": "行"}, {"weight": 2.571339155560308, "source": "經界", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 2.976804263668472, "source": "經界", "target": "政"}, {"weight": 2.060513531794317, "source": "經界", "target": "君"}, {"weight": 2.348195604246098, "source": "行", "target": "先"}, {"weight": 2.571339155560308, "source": "行", "target": "君"}, {"weight": 2.165874047452143, "source": "行", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 2.976804263668472, 